422:4. Code of the Witch of Justice: World Peace Must Be Protected!
423:???
426:Argh-Argh
427:Argh-argh!!
428:You want me to follow you...? Whoa, you're stronger than you look!
429:Frenzied Sparrows
431:Yuzu
433:...{var:player_nickname}?!
435:...Hey there?
