586:Matriarch Sanma
588:Matriarch Sanma, we just want to talk!
589:...We never wished to cause chaos.
590:But if we stay here, on this land, nothing awaits us... except death.
591:My family and I have all fallen ill.
592:A sudden, inexplicable weakness, hunger, and restlessness came over us... as if death itself were hanging over our heads.
593:I can endure the suffering, but I cannot risk the life of my unborn child.
594:We must save ourselves. My instincts tell me... if we leave this place... we may recover.
595:Matriarch Sanma, I might be able to find the source of your pain!
596:You... can help us?
597:Yes, please trust me!
598:What on earth is happening?! Sanma and the others are usually so gentle!!
