601:...Is that someone standing there?!
602:Sanma finally places her trust in us.//nYuzu steps forward and chants in a low voice. Vibrant green magic flows from the gem at the tip of her staff, turning into a gentle breeze that softly wraps around Sanma and her herd.
603:Found it.
604:A flower-shaped emblem of shimmering golden powder appears on Sanma's forehead.
606:Yuzu's magic envelops Sanma completely. The golden pollen dissolves as revitalizing energy surges through her body...
608:Elephants
609:Rooaaar!!
610:Yes!
