625:And the datura flower...?
626:...It's her familiar, an everlasting magical plant. Just like my red pandas, her datura helps her cast complex spells that a witch couldn't manage alone.
627:Argh... I thought that scent was familiar, but I brushed it off as a coincidence.
628:Come to think of it, it's been a whole month since she said she was coming to One Han City, but she still hasn't contacted me.
