865:The path of the Witch of Justice has always been a lonely one.
866:I'm Leia, Yuzu's magic mentor. She's with me at the moment, though... it's a bit hard to explain.
867:And just like that, she's running late for school yet again...
871:Alright... There are still other animals in the zoo affected by the pollen, though their symptoms are milder. Argh-Argh, Arrrrgh, and Argh! Argh! I need you three to stay behind and patrol the grounds. Help them out, and make sure they stay safely inside their enclosures.
875:By my divine will, I call upon the spirits of nature to protect him. Awaken, Piji the Brave!
876:With all the strength within me, I call upon the spirits of nature once more. Awaken, Piji the Brave!!
